### Create mood without timestamp (server sets createdAt = now)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/moods
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "score": 7,
  "note": "Felt focused"
}

### Create mood with custom past timestamp
POST http://localhost:8080/api/moods
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "score": 5,
  "note": "Backfilled entry",
  "ts": "2025-08-30T18%3A00%3A00Z"
}

### Create mood with future timestamp (should return 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/moods
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "score": 3,
  "note": "Future mood?",
  "ts": "2999-01-01T00%3A00%3A00Z"
}

### List moods (default page: page=0, size=20)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/moods
Accept: application/json

### Page 1 (0-based) with size 5
GET http://localhost:8080/api/moods?page=1&size=5
Accept: application/json

### Oversized size (service should cap it, e.g., 100)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/moods?page=0&size=999
Accept: application/json

### Date range: from 2025-08-30T00:00:00Z to 2025-09-03T00:00:00Z
GET http://localhost:8080/api/moods?from=2025-08-30T00%3A00%3A00Z&to=2025-09-03T00%3A00%3A00Z
Accept: application/json

### Open-ended: from only (everything since 2025-08-30T00:00:00Z)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/moods?from=2025-08-30T00%3A00%3A00Z
Accept: application/json

### Open-ended: to only (everything up to 2025-09-03T00:00:00Z)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/moods?to=2025-09-03T00%3A00%3A00Z
Accept: application/json

### Get missing (should be 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/moods/999999
Accept: application/json

### Create mood (no note, should default to "")
POST http://localhost:8080/api/moods
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "score": 6
}

### List moods (to see assigned id)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/moods
Accept: application/json

### Get mood by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/moods/1
Accept: application/json

### Update mood (score only, should keep existing note)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/moods/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "score": 7
}

### PUT with future timestamp (should be 400)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/moods/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "score": 5,
  "note": "Future test",
  "ts": "2999-01-01T00:00:00Z"
}

### Update mood (explicitly clear note with "")
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/moods/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "score": 7,
  "note": ""
}

### Create one
POST http://localhost:8080/api/moods
Content-Type: application/json

{ "score": 6 }

### Find ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/moods
Accept: application/json

### Delete (replace 1 with real id) -> expect 204
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/moods/1

### Get same id -> expect 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/moods/1
Accept: application/json


